{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2022-09-21 17:15:00', 'title': 'THE NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE PUBLISHES PIVOTAL TOFERSEN DATA THAT SHOW BENEFITS IN RARE, GENETIC FORM OF ALS', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MASS., SEPT. 21, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIOGEN INC. (NASDAQ: BIIB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE \xa0(NEJM) HAS PUBLISHED DETAILED RESULTS FROM THE PHASE 3 VALOR STUDY AND THE COMBINED ANALYSIS OF VALOR AND ITS OPEN LABEL EXTENSION (OLE) STUDY EVALUATING TOFERSEN FOR THE TREATMENT OF SUPEROXIDE DISMUTASE 1 (SOD1) AMYOTROPHIC LATERAL SCLEROSIS (ALS). THERE IS CURRENTLY NO TREATMENT TARGETED FOR SOD1-ALS.'}